    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.30-p002",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    subgraph A\n        A1[\"1\"]\n        A2[\"2\"]\n        A3[\"3\"]\n    end\n    subgraph B\n        B3[\"3\"]\n        B4[\"4\"]\n        B7[\"7\"]\n    end\n    A1 -- \"f\" --> B3\n    A2 -- \"f\" --> B4\n    A3 -- \"f\" --> B7\n```",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [],
      "pdfPageStart": 33,
      "pdfPageEnd": 33,
      "printedPageStart": 28,
      "printedPageEnd": 28,
      "reviewReasons": [],
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.30-p003",
      "kind": "definition",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**সংজ্ঞা ১০ (এক-এক ফাংশন):** যদি কোনো ফাংশন $f$ এর অধীনে এর ডোমেনের ভিন্ন ভিন্ন সদস্যের প্রতিবিষ্টি সর্বদা ভিন্ন হয়, তবে ফাংশনটিকে এক-এক (one-one) ফাংশন বলা হয়। অর্থাৎ $x_1, x_2 \\in$ ডোম $f$ এবং $x_1 \\neq x_2$ হলে $f(x_1) \\neq f(x_2)$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "f",
        "x_1, x_2 \\in",
        "f",
        "x_1 \\neq x_2",
        "f(x_1) \\neq f(x_2)"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 33,
      "pdfPageEnd": 33,
      "printedPageStart": 28,
      "printedPageEnd": 28,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.30-p004",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "উপরের সংজ্ঞা থেকে দেখা যায়, একটি ফাংশন $f : A \\to B$ এক-এক ফাংশন হবে, যদি ও কেবল যদি $f(x_1) = f(x_2)$ হলে $x_1 = x_2$ হয় যেখানে $x_1, x_2 \\in A$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "f : A \\to B",
        "f(x_1) = f(x_2)",
        "x_1 = x_2",
        "x_1, x_2 \\in A"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 33,
      "pdfPageEnd": 33,
      "printedPageStart": 28,
      "printedPageEnd": 28,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.30-p005",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**উদাহরণ ৩০.** $f(x) = 3x + 5, x \\in R$ ফাংশনটি কি এক-এক ফাংশন?",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "f(x) = 3x + 5, x \\in R"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 33,
      "pdfPageEnd": 33,
      "printedPageStart": 28,
      "printedPageEnd": 28,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.30-p006",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**সমাধান:** মনে করি $a, b \\in R$ এবং $f(a) = f(b)$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "a, b \\in R",
        "f(a) = f(b)"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 33,
      "pdfPageEnd": 33,
      "printedPageStart": 28,
      "printedPageEnd": 28,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.30-p007",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "তাহলে $3a + 5 = 3b + 5$ বা, $3a = 3b$ বা, $a = b$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "3a + 5 = 3b + 5",
        "3a = 3b",
        "a = b"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 33,
      "pdfPageEnd": 33,
      "printedPageStart": 28,
      "printedPageEnd": 28,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.30-p008",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "সুতরাং $f$ ফাংশনটি এক-এক।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "f"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 33,
      "pdfPageEnd": 33,
      "printedPageStart": 28,
      "printedPageEnd": 28,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.30-p009",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**উদাহরণ ৩১.** দেখাও যে, $F : R \\to R, F(x) = x^2$ ফাংশনটি এক-এক নয়।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "F : R \\to R, F(x) = x^2"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 33,
      "pdfPageEnd": 33,
      "printedPageStart": 28,
      "printedPageEnd": 28,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.30-p010",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**সমাধান:** $x_1 = -1, x_2 = 1$ নিয়ে দেখি যে, $x_1 \\in$ ডোম $F, x_2 \\in$ ডোম $F$ এবং $x_1 \\neq x_2$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "x_1 = -1, x_2 = 1",
        "x_1 \\in",
        "F, x_2 \\in",
        "F",
        "x_1 \\neq x_2"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 33,
      "pdfPageEnd": 33,
      "printedPageStart": 28,
      "printedPageEnd": 28,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.30-p011",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "কিন্তু $F(x_1) = F(-1) = (-1)^2 = 1, F(x_2) = F(1) = (1)^2 = 1$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "F(x_1) = F(-1) = (-1)^2 = 1, F(x_2) = F(1) = (1)^2 = 1"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 33,
      "pdfPageEnd": 33,
      "printedPageStart": 28,
      "printedPageEnd": 28,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
